WEBVTT

00:00:05.055 --> 00:00:11.055
Choose Help centre in the side menu.

00:00:11.436 --> 00:00:17.005
Type "captions" in the
Search the help centre box.

00:00:17.255 --> 00:00:20.806
Click Search.

00:00:21.056 --> 00:00:25.852
Click Review and approve captions.

00:00:26.102 --> 00:00:32.102
Click Mark as done when
you have finished a guide.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:38.420
Click Yes if the guide helped you.
